送通知。App 下载量超 5000 万次。Meta 回应称代码仅为探索，尚未决定推出，且不会建立中央人脸数据库。此前 Meta 曾因人脸识别问题在伊利诺伊州和得克萨斯州分别达成 6.5 亿美元和 14 亿美元和解。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq10bltr0b9ksltrs7mappfh","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/960/735.htm","publishedAt":"2026-06-06T00:01:06.701Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq10bltr0b9ksltrs7mappfh","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"据《连线》今日报道，Meta 通过多次应用更新将人脸识别代码推送到智能眼镜配套 App 中，代号“NameTag”。该功能利用已部署的三个 AI 模型将人脸转换为“人脸特征模板”，与手机本地数据库匹配，识别成功后向佩戴者发送通知。App 下载量超 5000 万次。Meta 回应称代码仅为探索，尚未决定推出，且不会建立中央人脸数据库。此前 Meta 曾因人脸识别问题在伊利诺伊州和得克萨斯州分别达成 6.5 亿美元和 14 亿美元和解。","reportEdition":"2026-06-06","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq12gsy20buksltr2nwivyhu","title":"苹果新版 Siri 不会被宣传为完成品，内部将其标记为“Beta”版","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-06-06T00:01:06.701Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq12gsy20buksltr2nwivyhu","https://www.ithome.com/0/960/739.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq12gsy20buksltr2nwivyhu","title":"苹果新版 Siri 不会被宣传为完成品，内部将其标记为“Beta”版","originalTitle":"","summary":"苹果新版Siri被内部标记为“Beta”版，不会作为完成品宣传；可能设置等待清单供用户尝试。iOS 27细节：通知到达重新设计，通知中心手势移至左上角；“查找”应用视觉重设计；照片“清理”功能改进；大量底层安全改进。部分Siri查询将通过Go