g Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq1ikzj50g4jsltr7vm9qbst","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-10T04:49:32.496Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"开发者用Qwen2.5-3B构建了五人森林生物多智能体经济体，每个智能体独立运行，通过vLLM部署在Modal，以Gradio为交互窗口。3B模型在100%调用中输出有效JSON，但经济判断能力弱。通过设计稀缺性（食物品种限制、易腐坏、冬季燃料危机）和优化提示词（禁止买入自产物品、给出示例）提升决策质量。15轮模拟中，蜜价从10跌至3、柴价从4涨至7、财富基尼系数从0.14扩至0.38。项目展示了小模型可靠格式化与不可靠推理之间的工程填补。","reportEdition":"2026-06-06","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq0msqwn07oisltr2sw1wjbg","title":"腾讯混元联合人大开源PlanningBench评估框架","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-06T00:01:06.701Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq0msqwn07oisltr2sw1wjbg","https://x.com/TencentHunyuan/status/2062803141314437391"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq0msqwn07oisltr2sw1wjbg","title":"腾讯混元联合人大开源PlanningBench评估框架","originalTitle":"","summary":"腾讯混元（Tencent Hunyuan）与中国人民大学高瓴人工智能学院合作，开源PlanningBench——一个可扩展、可验证的LLM规划能力评估与训练框架。该框架包含30+真实世界规划任务，支持自动验证和训练。PlanningBench旨在推动LLM从“说”到“做”的规划能力发展。资源已发布于arXiv、GitHub及HuggingFace。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq0msqwn07oisltr2sw1wjbg","originalUrl":"https://x.com/TencentHunyuan/status/2062803141314437391","publishedAt":"2026-06-06T00:01:06.701Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-i4gq4t","originalSourceName